abstract: >
  Open-source Python and Marimo application for exploring the distribution across counties of
  National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST) Tracking Community
  Resilience (TraCR) data. The project demonstrates a reusable analytical
  pipeline from public source data through acquisition, processing,
  analysis, view preparation, and interactive visualization.

